This folder contains the code and configuration for the RapidsSE performance
test harness.

Directory layout:
  ./configs     Contains the configuration files used to define the tests
                to be run and the environment that they are to run in.
  ./scripts     Contains the scripts that are invoked by Bamboo to
                actually run the performance tests and store the results.

  ./scripts/septest   The SE Performance Test (septest). Contains the main
                      python script that can be run.
                      Can be run from the scripts directory with: 
                        python septest


